ALgorithm for Withdrawing Cash
1. user slots in card in atm machine
2. user types in 4 digit pin
3. if pin is correct, open the account selection page
4. else, print "invalid pin"
5. user selects account type
6. user types in amount to be withdrawn
7. if amount wanted by user is greater than account balance, print "insufficient balance"
8. Else, user receives amount wanted.
